1. Upstream: PS2Recomp
----------------------

This repository is a fork of PS2Recomp, https://github.com/ran-j/PS2Recomp,
GPL-3.0, by Ran-j and its contributors. The runtime's host layer (runtime/,
iop/, tests/) and the recompiler (tooling/recompiler/) descend from it; the
fork point is upstream commit eb8688b2f ("Emulate PS2 float semantics for EE
FPU results and DIV.S/RSQRT.S (#272)", 2026-10-14). Upstream's history is
kept in this repository's history, with its authors.


2. PCSX2's SPU2
---------------

iop/src/emulator/spu2/ is a port of PCSX2's SPU2 emulation,
https://github.com/PCSX2/pcsx2, at commit
091ab68708a555198d80a7216965481c7ddd0d98, copyright 2002-2026 PCSX2 Dev Team,
GPL-3.0-or-later; iop/src/emulator/spu2/README.md lists each file's source
and what changed. runtime/src/lib/ps2_spu_voice.cpp and
runtime/src/lib/sound/spu_gauss_table.h follow the same code (Mixer.cpp,
ADSR.cpp, interpolate_table.h at that commit). Thanks to the PCSX2 team and to
the people its sources credit (Dr. Hell, nocash, Near, Ryphecha and others).


