5. Sony's libraries
-------------------

No Sony code is in this repository. runtime/src/game/sce/kernel.h and
eeregs.h name records and registers by the field names of Sony's headers;
libmc.h uses ps2sdk's public libmc.h names. The SDK functions the games link
(runtime/src/game/sce/not_ported.tsv) run as the recompiled originals, made
from the player's own disc and never in this repository. The recompiler's
SDK signature table (tooling/recompiler/ps2xAnalyzer/include/ps2recomp/
sce_symbol_database_data.h: hashes and sizes) is upstream PS2Recomp's.


